  unitName: Knight Will
  unitId: 50112
  unitNumber: 165
  description: A knight from the ruined La Veda Republic, history books say he was
    the only one who fought against the world's destruction until the very end. He
    was known as the strongest warrior in the Veda cavalry. People wanted to know
    if he was stronger than Atro, but legend claims he didn't care, saying, "What
    would it matter?"
  summonDesc: Are you worthy of me<br>dedicating my sword to you?<br>Let me measure
    your worth.
  fusionDesc: Strength is always necessary,<br>even in something as simple <br>as
    keeping one's faith.
